# Move Down (Alt+j) on a Flagged entry changes nothing, since the Flagged view cannot be reordered, and its context menu leaves the command out.
size 100 50
file <<END
Shop:
	- Milk @flag
	- Eggs @flag
END
keys gF <A-j> \
see Commands:
hide Move Down
keys <Esc>
quit
saved <<END
Shop:
	- Milk @flag
	- Eggs @flag
END
